    {
      "id": "ascii-case-order",
      "description": "Uppercase sorts before lowercase in code unit order. Locale-aware compare (localeCompare, ICU collation) puts references/ and scripts/ first and gives a wrong hash. The shebang script also shows that the executable flag is not part of the hash.",
